Subject: [PATCH 03291/11362] [conductor] PHASE B2 (RESERVED INFRA) --
 POSITIVE-CONTROL-FAILED GUARD: an ARC efficiency/proposer task whose
 positive_control_passed=False (false_negative_risk OPEN) MUST NOT be
 aggregated by the capstone as a valid null (the .420 A1 trap: exp4544 nulled
 with a FAILED positive control -- the proposer produced zero reachable plans
 -- yet the capstone still read it as an honest efficiency null). Add a
 capstone/reader guard + a regression assert. Asserting tests.

Automated research step by research conductor.
Task ID: exp4563-b2

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
